n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260514214544\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.125 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1657/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8730/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4815/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6299/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   86.031      1 -total\n 51.67%   44.449      1 Template:Location\n 37.51%   32.269      1 Template:Refs\n 10.85%    9.337      6 Template:Cite_book\n  8.51%    7.324      6 Template:Cite_publication\n  7.34%    6.314      1 Template:Cite_book/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_2nd_edition_(revised)/A_Grand_Tour_of_the_Realms\n  3.07%    2.643      1 Template:Cite_book/The_Veiled_Dragon/Paperback_(1996)/Map\n  2.57%    2.214      1 Template:Cite_book/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_3rd_edition\n  2.50%    2.153      1 Template:Cite_book/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Guide\n  2.50%    2.151      1 Template:Cite_book/Cult_of_the_Dragon\n-->\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.8_prod_forgottenrealms:pcache:idhash:105059-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260514214544 and revision id 955588. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>","error":null,"source":{"wiki":"forgottenrealms.fandom.com","url":"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&format=json&prop=text&page=Ilipur","fetchedAt":"2026-05-17T07:01:47Z"}}